cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Geoff-Sim, cite this software and identify the exact Git commit,
  policy and dataset used. Also cite the relevant upstream methods and the
  experiment report supporting your claim.
type: software
title: 'Geoff-Sim: Unitree G1 simulation and human-aware navigation research'
authors:
  - family-names: Batty
    given-names: David
    affiliation: University of Liverpool
repository-code: 'https://github.com/DavidBatty95/Geoff-Sim'
url: 'https://github.com/DavidBatty95/Geoff-Sim'
abstract: >-
  A simulation-first research platform integrating Unitree G1 locomotion,
  MuJoCo, ROS 2 Humble, onboard perception, human-aware navigation, experimental
  payload transport and source-linked evaluation. Research and development
  evidence is distinguished from operational acceptance.
keywords:
  - robotics
  - humanoid
  - Unitree G1
  - MuJoCo
  - ROS 2
  - social navigation
  - reproducible research
